process control","specialist review"],"text":"The controlled Central Rules source provides current central benefit qualification and process context. It cannot be used to validate a medical certificate, decide a claim or infer personal facts.","contentSha256":"c1a9a9369cae446fd787f942bc772a55c3d024e11b9fc5eafed9727b809f6616"},{"chunkId":"esi-general-regulations-benefits-wave4c-001","registrySourceId":"employees-state-insurance-general-regulations-1950","title":"Saved-law benefit and claim-process context","sectionReference":"Benefit and claim regulations","pageStart":20,"pageEnd":34,"priority":100,"reasonCodes":["ESI_BENEFIT_PROCESS_CONTROLS_RECORDED_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_BENEFIT_PROCESS_CONTROL_GAPS_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_BENEFIT_PROCESS_FACTS_MISSING"],"retrievalTerms":["benefit process","claim regulations","saved law","transition"],"text":"The consolidated General Regulations are retained only as a saved-law candidate for operational benefit-process context. Their prospective use, forms, periods and transition treatment require qualified legal review.","contentSha256":"437d170a23831e5ab18aa002d4f8a711d8d0d148d721760ef8a278136e227c55"},{"chunkId":"esi-code-medical-administration-wave4c-001","registrySourceId":"social-security-code-2020","title":"ESI medical-administration framework","sectionReference":"Sections 39–40 and related Chapter IV provisions","pageStart":35,"pageEnd":40,"priority":100,"reasonCodes":["ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_CONTROLS_RECORDED_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_CONTROL_GAPS_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_FACTS_MISSING"],"retrievalTerms":["medical administration","State Government","Corporation","medical facilities"],"text":"The controlled Code source provides central State and Corporation medical-administration context. Wave 4C records organisation source-routing controls and does not select a provider, treatment or benefit scale.","contentSha256":"b81a52c9ede8c8a12964e9abe3860477e24f55b9ca2ba22cfdaa2d384697140d"},{"chunkId":"esi-central-rules-medical-wave4c-001","registrySourceId":"social-security-central-rules-2026","title":"Current central medical-administration source context","sectionReference":"Rules 25–26","pageStart":165,"pageEnd":170,"priority":100,"reasonCodes":["ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_CONTROLS_RECORDED_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_CONTROL_GAPS_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_FACTS_MISSING"],"retrievalTerms":["medical administration","State implementation","Corporation model","source routing"],"text":"The controlled Central Rules source provides current central medical-administration context. State, Union Territory, society, local facility and agreement sources remain outside the controlled pack.","contentSha256":"1f4ccfc236d6df5c4acee05bc4759bd79eab5b98c2041f7a9b1e379b732fc465"},{"chunkId":"esi-medical-practitioners-wave4c-001","registrySourceId":"social-security-esi-medical-practitioners-so-2352e-2026","title":"Controlled medical-practitioner authority source","sectionReference":"S.O. 2352(E), dated 8 May 2026","pageStart":1,"pageEnd":2,"priority":100,"reasonCodes":["ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_CONTROLS_RECORDED_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_CONTROL_GAPS_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_FACTS_MISSING","ESI_BENEFIT_PROCESS_CONTROLS_RECORDED_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_BENEFIT_PROCESS_CONTROL_GAPS_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_BENEFIT_PROCESS_FACTS_MISSING"],"retrievalTerms":["medical practitioner","certification authority","S.O. 2352(E)"],"text":"S.O. 2352(E) is retained as a controlled medical-practitioner authority source. Wave 4C does not validate any certificate, diagnosis, treatment record or individual eligibility.","contentSha256":"05d8c9c1dc826c6fbb6b2478984db74529676029b46e72241c7a1671ec7100a6"},{"chunkId":"esi-other-beneficiaries-scheme-wave4c-001","registrySourceId":"other-beneficiaries-medical-facilities-scheme-2026","title":"Other-beneficiaries medical-facilities scheme context","sectionReference":"Other Beneficiaries Medical Facilities Scheme, 2026","pageStart":1,"pageEnd":3,"priority":100,"reasonCodes":["ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_CONTROLS_RECORDED_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_CONTROL_GAPS_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_FACTS_MISSING"],"retrievalTerms":["other beneficiaries","medical facilities scheme","user charge","source control"],"text":"The controlled scheme provides bounded source context for other-beneficiary medical facilities. The user-charge instrument, local implementation and any individual access decision remain unresolved.","contentSha256":"b5f56ff6688d06efd6e3c4bd04b0a52635ce611fdd7180bfab9ad4f49ea453aa"},{"chunkId":"esi-commencement-wave4c-001","registrySourceId":"social-security-code-commencement-so-5319e-2025","title":"Commencement and transition context","sectionReference":"S.O. 5319(E), dated 21 November 2025","pageStart":1,"pageEnd":2,"priority":100,"reasonCodes":["ESI_SPECIAL_ROUTE_CONTROLS_RECORDED_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_SPECIAL_ROUTE_CONTROL_GAPS_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_SPECIAL_ROUTE_FACTS_MISSING","ESI_BENEFIT_PROCESS_CONTROLS_RECORDED_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_BENEFIT_PROCESS_CONTROL_GAPS_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_BENEFIT_PROCESS_FACTS_MISSING","ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_CONTROLS_RECORDED_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_CONTROL_GAPS_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_FACTS_MISSING"],"retrievalTerms":["commencement","Chapter IV","transition","saved law"],"text":"The controlled commencement notification is retained as effective-date context. Missing hazardous, plantation, State medical and saved-regulation dependencies cannot be filled by retrieval or provider output.","contentSha256":"cf3a7292472d165fdd92e92e992a35a6d2aadce2885480838a42e35181bc002c"},{"chunkId":"esi-corrigendum-wave4c-001","registrySourceId":"social-security-code-corrigendum-so-5936e-2025","title":"Corrigendum and transition context","sectionReference":"S.O. 5936(E), dated 19 December 2025","pageStart":1,"pageEnd":2,"priority":100,"reasonCodes":["ESI_SPECIAL_ROUTE_CONTROLS_RECORDED_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_SPECIAL_ROUTE_CONTROL_GAPS_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_SPECIAL_ROUTE_FACTS_MISSING","ESI_BENEFIT_PROCESS_CONTROLS_RECORDED_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_BENEFIT_PROCESS_CONTROL_GAPS_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_BENEFIT_PROCESS_FACTS_MISSING","ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_CONTROLS_RECORDED_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_CONTROL_GAPS_SPECIALIST_REVIEW","ESI_MEDICAL_ADMINISTRATION_FACTS_MISSING"],"retrievalTerms":["corrigendum","transition","Chapter IV","source scope"],"text":"The controlled corrigendum is retained as transition context. It does not supply missing special-route, benefit-process or State medical-administration sources.","contentSha256":"73df874ab64c062b9822c3874618b5b942eb93e64871c8854632f4b22da1467b"}]}